OL,3,GNEWSALancashire's Make a Difference
OL,4,AAwards winners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young girl who is determined to help
OL,7,Fthose around her and a sports group
OL,8,Fproviding a lifeline to disabled people
OL,9,Facross Blackpool are among the winners
OL,10,Fof BBC Radio Lancashire's Make a
OL,11,FDifference Awards 2026.
OL,13,FThe ceremony featured stories of
OL,14,Fkindness, resilience and dedication at
OL,15,FLancaster's Ashton Hall.
OL,17,FWinners were announced in eight
OL,18,Fcategories that recognised people who
OL,19,Fgo above and beyond to help others and
OL,20,Fmake a real difference in the
OL,21,Fcommunity.
